## Anti Pattern

- [ ] **No output validation**: Blind trust in AI responses
- [ ] **Missing error handling**: Unhandled API failures
- [ ] **No caching**: Repeated identical requests
- [ ] **Over-sized prompts**: Wasting tokens
- [ ] **Hardcoded API keys**: Security risk
- [ ] **No rate limiting**: API quota exhaustion

## Best Practice

- [ ] **Output validation**: Always validate AI responses
- [ ] **Robust error handling**: Graceful degradation
- [ ] **Caching**: Reduce costs và latency
- [ ] **Token optimization**: Efficient prompts
- [ ] **Security**: Environment variables for keys
- [ ] **Monitoring**: Track usage và costs

